  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $k\\geq 3$ and $f_k(N)$ be the maximum value of $\\sum_{n\\in A}\\frac{1}{n}$, where $A$ ranges over all subsets of $\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}$ which contain no subset of size $k$ with the same pairwise least common multiple.\nEstimate $f_k(N)$.",
